src="https://mavens-group.github.io/news/2026-issmd/slides/what-to-measure_hu_54f3f6184d7339eb.webp"
width="760"
height="570"
loading="lazy" data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;
The prediction, and what is still open.
&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Next, we will compute T₂ directly on this bath and apply the same workflow to TiO₂.&lt;/p&gt;
